# Full swiftformat default ruleset. Runs as a lint gate via prek and can be
# applied in write mode with `just lint` / `swiftformat .`.
# Two rules are tuned to agree with the SwiftLint gate (opening_brace,
# trailing_comma), which conflict with swiftformat's defaults.
--swiftversion 5.5
--disable wrapMultilineStatementBraces
--trailingcommas never
